---
---

<section class="section safety" id="safety">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid">

      <!-- E2EE column -->
      <div class="col">
        <div class="col-icon e2ee-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="16" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="badge">End-to-End Encrypted</div>
        <h2 class="col-title">We literally <span class="gradient-text">can't read</span> your messages.</h2>
        <p class="col-body">
          Yapper uses the Signal Protocol — the same cryptography trusted by Signal, WhatsApp, and Google Messages.
          Messages are encrypted on your device before they leave it, and decrypted only on the recipient's device.
        </p>

        <ul class="fact-list">
          <li>
            <span class="fact-dot"></span>
            <span>Keys generated on your device, <em>never sent to our servers</em></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Parental controls column -->
      <div class="col">
        <div class="col-icon parent-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="badge">Parental Controls</div>
        <h2 class="col-title">Safe for families. <span class="gradient-text">By design.</span></h2>
        <p class="col-body">
          E2EE is inviolable — parents can never read their child's messages and that's a feature.
          What parents <em>can</em> do is control who their children connect with.
        </p>

        <ul class="fact-list">
          <li>
            <span class="fact-dot green"></span>
            <span>Friend requests to children require <strong>parent approval</strong></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fact-dot green"></span>
            <span>Server joins by children require parent approval before membership</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fact-dot green"></span>
            <span>Screen time limits via <strong>iOS DeviceActivity</strong> &amp; <strong>Android UsageStats</strong></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fact-dot green"></span>
            <span>Parents see only metadata — <em>who</em> messaged, never <em>what</em></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .col {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .col-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .e2ee-icon {
    background: rgba(124,58,237,0.12);
    color: var(--color-brand-light);
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.2);
  }

  .parent-icon {
    background: rgba(74,222,128,0.1);
    color: #4ade80;
    border: 1px solid rgba(74,222,128,0.2);
  }

  .col-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .col-body {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .col-body em { color: var(--color-text-primary); font-style: normal; }

  .fact-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .fact-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .fact-list li strong { color: var(--color-text-primary); }
  .fact-list li em    { color: var(--color-brand-light); font-style: normal; }

  .fact-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-brand-light);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .fact-dot.green { background: #4ade80; }
</style>
